============================================================================================
GRADIENT IN THE AXIS ONLY — decoupling direction from step size
============================================================================================
  n_active=4, R=0.6, dt=0.5, k=15. Closed form (validated 0.00241).
  base: th=hypot(al,be) wraps at ~23.9 g.  axis_only: th fixed at 0.35,
  direction carried entirely by ph=atan2(be,al), which cannot wrap.

